  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 2704.12 Grant Application Confidentiality. Confidential commercial or financial information provided with a grant application shall be exempt from disclosure under RSA 91-A:5.\n\nSource. #8975, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRED: 3-12-08\n\nNew. #9498, eff 7-1-09 (from Res 2704.11), EXPIRED: 7-1-17",
